# Ritual source footage — the Flow/Veo master clips.
# These live in source-footage/ and NOT in public/: anything under public/ is
# copied verbatim into dist/ by Vite, so a master left there ships to production
# as dead weight (1.48 MB was being deployed before this was caught).
# The extracted frames in public/frames/ ARE committed; the masters are the input
# that produced them, reproducible from WORKFLOW.md §Phase 0 plus the ffmpeg
# pipeline in DESIGN.md §6.2/§8.
source-footage/
public/*.mp4
public/*.mov

